<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">willpower</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">willpower</ansi> stat measures your mental fortitude,
inner resolve, and connection to the unseen forces of the
world.

<ansi fg="yellow">Effects: </ansi>

Willpower is your primary defense against mental attacks and
magical influences. It also affects your Conviction pool and
how quickly Conviction recovers over time.

Willpower improves through use -- the more you exercise your
mental resilience and draw upon inner strength, the more it
grows.

